[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:05.16]left a single note and went on their way
[00:10.00]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.00]now it plays here every single day
[00:19.71]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:24.26]One note at a time
[00:29.85]from people passing through
[00:34.89]a name beside a line
[00:39.91]and part of it is you
[00:55.38]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
